    {
      "id": "seg:code:declaration:0006:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nnonisolated\nfunc seek(to time: CMTime) async -> Bool\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nnonisolated\nfunc seek(to time: CMTime) async -> Bool\n```",
      "sourceHash": "af213a7af986e6c9132293f908d89c7030524120bf3416af8c984fc17308d286",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:heading:discussion:0007:0001",
      "source": "Discussion",
      "ko": "Discussion",
      "sourceHash": "5eb6cf647d2c5d14a044e2d103dcef4cf0cdc872434c374debc1043092bc4746",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "Use this method to seek to a specified time in the player item and be notified when the operation completes.",
      "ko": "이 메서드를 사용하면 플레이어 항목에서 지정된 시간으로 이동하고 작업이 완료될 때 알림을 받을 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "697a22d96d0a6eef670db178f3d4833d74b1d160ef8d3a7c19859aaa9a81996e",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "If the seek request completes without being interrupted (either by another seek request or by any other operation), the completion handler you provide is executed with the `finished` parameter set to [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true).",
      "ko": "다른 탐색 요청이나 다른 작업으로 중단되지 않고 탐색 요청이 완료되면, 제공한 completion handler가 `finished` 매개변수가 [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)로 설정된 상태에서 실행됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "5457db9d2c02776065b0b2623653c967d416be43d5eaf6e561e59fc7c07087ad",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "If another seek request is already in progress when you call this method, the completion handler for the in-progress seek request is executed immediately with the `finished` parameter set to [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false).",
      "ko": "이 메서드를 호출할 때 이미 다른 탐색 요청이 진행 중이면, 진행 중인 탐색 요청의 completion handler가 즉시 실행되며 `finished` 매개변수가 [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false)로 설정됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "928683fa645c65cbff02893db89dbbaac901a44c3fb44ba1ac00c7ef13df4717",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:heading:parameters:0010:0001",
      "source": "Parameters",
      "ko": "Parameters",
      "sourceHash": "e68b36b17cbd990802f57741cb75cf3a73fa66a61999b0cd70e3cf7d26cfb25f",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0011:0001",
      "source": "`time`: The time to which to seek.",
      "ko": "`time`: 탐색할 시간입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "aba4d5ec2272b3eeb8acf018f6bd0200b43b206d56014df7a7ada27995fd6371",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0011:0002",
      "source": "`completionHandler`: The block to invoke when the seek operation has either been completed or been interrupted. The block takes one argument: - **finished**: Indicates whether the seek operation completed.",
      "ko": "`completionHandler`: 탐색 작업이 완료되었거나 중단되었을 때 호출되는 블록입니다. 블록은 다음 인수를 하나 받습니다: - **finished**: 탐색 작업이 완료되었는지를 나타냅니다.",
      "sourceHash": "a9dacb75d5c5d9773dde7af0f363ea1615226f01b483d0777e512238f369e252",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
